        {
            "name": "pay_and_record",
            "docs": [
                "The core instruction: pay the seller AND record reputation, atomically.",
                "",
                "This replaces the old two-step flow (raw SPL transfer, then a separate",
                "record_payment call) whose recorded amount was never verified against",
                "any real transfer — reputation was effectively a free-write counter.",
                "Here the token movement happens via CPI *inside* this instruction, so",
                "the amount recorded is provably the amount that moved, and the protocol",
                "fee is enforced by the program rather than being optional client",
                "behavior.",
                "",
                "The buyer signs (they're moving their own tokens), which also makes the",
                "reputation record buyer-attested. A buyer≠seller check closes the",
                "single-wallet self-vouch; the per-pair BuyerSellerLink PDA lets the",
                "scoring down-weight repeat counterparties, so two-wallet wash trading",
                "is diminished rather than linear."
            ],
            "discriminator": [
                14,
                182,
                137,
                104,
                92,
                23,
                138,
                230
            ],
            "accounts": [
                {
                    "name": "buyer",
                    "writable": true,
                    "signer": true
                },
                {
                    "name": "seller",
                    "docs": [
                        "The seller's wallet — deliberately NOT a signer. It's only used to",
                        "derive/validate which SellerProfile PDA this payment applies to, and",
                        "as the required owner of the destination token account.",
                        "seller_token_account owner constraint below."
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "name": "seller_profile",
                    "writable": true,
                    "pda": {
                        "seeds": [
                            {
                                "kind": "const",
                                "value": [
                                    115,
                                    101,
                                    108,
                                    108,
                                    101,
                                    114
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "kind": "account",
                                "path": "seller"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "buyer_seller_link",
                    "docs": [
                        "Tracks that this buyer has paid this seller before, so repeat",
                        "transactions can be down-weighted in the score."
                    ],
                    "writable": true,
                    "pda": {
                        "seeds": [
                            {
                                "kind": "const",
                                "value": [
                                    108,
                                    105,
                                    110,
                                    107
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "kind": "account",
                                "path": "seller"
                            },
                            {
                                "kind": "account",
                                "path": "buyer"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "config",
                    "pda": {
                        "seeds": [
                            {
                                "kind": "const",
                                "value": [
                                    99,
                                    111,
                                    110,
                                    102,
                                    105,
                                    103
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                },
                {
                    "name": "mint"
                },
                {
                    "name": "buyer_token_account",
                    "writable": true
                },
                {
                    "name": "seller_token_account",
                    "writable": true
                },
                {
                    "name": "treasury_token_account",
                    "writable": true
